{"id":"fa51e54333a02e2c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/601_Åqvist_道义系统_G.md","title":"601 Åqvist 道义系统 G","display":"601_Åqvist_道义系统_G","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:Y\\text{ 有限}\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{obl}_G.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\quad \\bot,\\quad \\operatorname{neg},\\quad \\operatorname{imp},\\quad \\operatorname{obl}_G.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{obl}_G:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{obl}_G:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg A=\\operatorname{neg}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\to B=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_G(A\\mid B)=\\operatorname{obl}_G(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_G(A\\mid B)=\\operatorname{obl}_G(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号不是原始构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2.1-命题原子\">2.1 命题原子</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.2-底公式\">2.2 底公式</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.3-否定\">2.3 否定</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.4-蕴含\">2.4 蕴含</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"2.5-条件义务\">2.5 条件义务</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{obl}_G(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{obl}_G(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-自由变元\">3. 自由变元</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{601}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{601}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(O_G(A\\mid B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(O_G(A\\mid B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{601}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>所有公式的绑定变元集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{601}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{601}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{601}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{601}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-命题替换\">4. 命题替换</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{601}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{601}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{601}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{601}\\)</span> 唯一扩张为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(O_G(A\\mid B))=O_G(\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\mid\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(O_G(A\\mid B))=O_G(\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\mid\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价定义为构造树相等：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,601}B\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\alpha,601}B\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并记</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{601}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{601}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{601}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{601}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{601}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{601},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{601}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-公理集合\">5. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>定义命题公理族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{601}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{601}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{601}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{601}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{601}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{601}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Åqvist <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的条件义务核心公理族为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{OK}^{601}\n=\n\\{O_G(A\\to B\\mid C)\\to(O_G(A\\mid C)\\to O_G(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{OK}^{601}\n=\n\\{O_G(A\\to B\\mid C)\\to(O_G(A\\mid C)\\to O_G(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{601}\n=\n\\{O_G(A\\mid B)\\to\\neg O_G(\\neg A\\mid B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{601}\n=\n\\{O_G(A\\mid B)\\to\\neg O_G(\\neg A\\mid B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{G}^{601}\n=\n\\{(O_G(A\\mid B)\\land O_G(B\\mid C))\\to O_G(A\\mid C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{G}^{601}\n=\n\\{(O_G(A\\mid B)\\land O_G(B\\mid C))\\to O_G(A\\mid C):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{G}^{601}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{G}^{601}\\)</span> 是本条目的目标特异公理族；它把条件义务沿条件链传递。</p>\n<p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{601}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{OK}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{G}^{601}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{601}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{OK}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{OD}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{G}^{601}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-推理规则关系\">6. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<p>分离规则定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{601}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{601}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>义务后件规则定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{OC}^{601}\n=\n\\{((A\\to B),\\,O_G(A\\mid C)\\to O_G(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{OC}^{601}\n=\n\\{((A\\to B),\\,O_G(A\\mid C)\\to O_G(B\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>条件等价规则定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{CE}^{601}\n=\n\\{((B\\leftrightarrow C),\\,O_G(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow O_G(A\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{CE}^{601}\n=\n\\{((B\\leftrightarrow C),\\,O_G(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow O_G(A\\mid C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{601}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{OC}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{CE}^{601}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{601}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{OC}^{601}\n\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{CE}^{601}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其显示分式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{601}A\\to B}{\\vdash_{601}O_G(A\\mid C)\\to O_G(B\\mid C)}\\;(OC),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{601}B\\leftrightarrow C}{\\vdash_{601}O_G(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow O_G(A\\mid C)}\\;(CE).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\;(MP),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{601}A\\to B}{\\vdash_{601}O_G(A\\mid C)\\to O_G(B\\mid C)}\\;(OC),\\quad\n\\frac{\\vdash_{601}B\\leftrightarrow C}{\\vdash_{601}O_G(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow O_G(A\\mid C)}\\;(CE).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\)</span>。一个从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 出发的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"601\">\\(601\\)</span>-证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi=((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，并且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\">\\(\\Delta_i\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 的有限子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，恰有下列理由之一成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"7.1-假设行\">7.1 假设行</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma,\\qquad \\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in\\Gamma,\\qquad \\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"7.2-公理行\">7.2 公理行</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{601},\\qquad \\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{601},\\qquad \\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"7.3-分离规则行\">7.3 分离规则行</h2>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\">\\(B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_k=(A_j\\to A_i),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_k=(A_j\\to A_i),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"7.4-义务后件规则行\">7.4 义务后件规则行</h2>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\to B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_j=A\\to B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i=O_G(A\\mid C)\\to O_G(B\\mid C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i=O_G(A\\mid C)\\to O_G(B\\mid C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"7.5-条件等价规则行\">7.5 条件等价规则行</h2>\n<p>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_j=B\\leftrightarrow C,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_j=B\\leftrightarrow C,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A_i=O_G(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow O_G(A\\mid C),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A_i=O_G(A\\mid B)\\leftrightarrow O_G(A\\mid C),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{601}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{601}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{601}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{601}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{601}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{601}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{601}A\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash_{601}A\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{601}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{601}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{601}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{last}_{601}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{601}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{601}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{601}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{601}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>可核验证书集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{601}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{601},\\ \n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{601}(\\Gamma),\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{601}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{601}=\\{(\\Gamma,A,\\pi):\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{601},\\ \n\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{601}(\\Gamma),\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{601}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-语义结构与满足\">9. 语义结构与满足</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"601\">\\(601\\)</span>-选择函数模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SelMod}_{601}^{G}\">\\(\\mathsf{SelMod}_{601}^{G}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Best}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Best}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Best}:\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(\\operatorname{Best}:\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，并且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\subseteq X\">\\(\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\subseteq X\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(X\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{Best}(X)\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。G-链约束为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Best}(Y)\\subseteq X\\land \\operatorname{Best}(Z)\\subseteq Y\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Best}(Z)\\subseteq X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Best}(Y)\\subseteq X\\land \\operatorname{Best}(Z)\\subseteq Y\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Best}(Z)\\subseteq X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式真值集</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{601}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句递归定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n\\llbracket\\bot\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\nW\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket\\neg A\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\nW\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n(W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket A\\to B\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n(W\\setminus\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\llbracket O_G(A\\mid B)\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nW,&amp;\\operatorname{Best}(\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M},\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\text{otherwise}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\llbracket O_G(A\\mid B)\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\begin{cases}\nW,&amp;\\operatorname{Best}(\\llbracket B\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M},\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\text{otherwise}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足与语义后承为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{601}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{601}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in\\llbracket A\\rrbracket_{601}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{601}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Best})\\in\\mathsf{SelMod}_{601}^{G}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{601}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{601}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{601}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Best})\\in\\mathsf{SelMod}_{601}^{G}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{601}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{601}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标区分\">10. 目标区分</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"601\">\\(601\\)</span> 的目标差异由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{G}^{601}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{G}^{601}\\)</span> 给出：它把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_G(A\\mid B)\">\\(O_G(A\\mid B)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_G(B\\mid C)\">\\(O_G(B\\mid C)\\)</span> 合成为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O_G(A\\mid C)\">\\(O_G(A\\mid C)\\)</span>。该公理不是 CK 的条件分配、不是 CEM，也不是单纯 ID。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{G}^{601}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{601},\\operatorname{FV}_{601},\\operatorname{BV}_{601},\\mathsf{Subst}_{601},\\operatorname{Sub}_{601},\\equiv_{\\alpha,601},\\mathsf{Ax}_{601},\\mathsf{Rule}_{601},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{601},\\operatorname{last}_{601},\\vdash_{601},\\mathsf{Thm}_{601},\\mathsf{Cert}_{601},\n\\mathsf{SelMod}_{601}^{G},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{601},\\Vdash_{601},\\models_{601}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal A_{G}^{601}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{601},\\operatorname{FV}_{601},\\operatorname{BV}_{601},\\mathsf{Subst}_{601},\\operatorname{Sub}_{601},\\equiv_{\\alpha,601},\\mathsf{Ax}_{601},\\mathsf{Rule}_{601},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{601},\\operatorname{last}_{601},\\vdash_{601},\\mathsf{Thm}_{601},\\mathsf{Cert}_{601},\n\\mathsf{SelMod}_{601}^{G},\\llbracket-\\rrbracket_{601},\\Vdash_{601},\\models_{601}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含条件义务公式、句法替换、公理族、规则关系、有限证明、选择函数语义与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性或完备性定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"2.1-命题原子","text":"2.1 命题原子","level":2},{"id":"2.2-底公式","text":"2.2 底公式","level":2},{"id":"2.3-否定","text":"2.3 否定","level":2},{"id":"2.4-蕴含","text":"2.4 蕴含","level":2},{"id":"2.5-条件义务","text":"2.5 条件义务","level":2},{"id":"3.-自由变元","text":"3. 自由变元","level":1},{"id":"4.-命题替换","text":"4. 命题替换","level":1},{"id":"5.-公理集合","text":"5. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"6.-推理规则关系","text":"6. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"7.-证明对象","text":"7. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.1-假设行","text":"7.1 假设行","level":2},{"id":"7.2-公理行","text":"7.2 公理行","level":2},{"id":"7.3-分离规则行","text":"7.3 分离规则行","level":2},{"id":"7.4-义务后件规则行","text":"7.4 义务后件规则行","level":2},{"id":"7.5-条件等价规则行","text":"7.5 条件等价规则行","level":2},{"id":"8.-可证性","text":"8. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"9.-语义结构与满足","text":"9. 语义结构与满足","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标区分","text":"10. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\m